      "width": 336,
      "height": 232,
      "text": "**The whole model**\n\n$$\n\\hat p = \\sigma\\left(w^\\top x + b\\right) = \\frac{1}{1 + e^{-(w^\\top x + b)}}\n$$\n\nTraining makes $L(w, b)$ as small as it can."
